  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4204.07 Audits. All auditing rules, procedures and forms shall be the same as those set forth in Saf-C 304 and Saf-C 308.\n\nSource. #7348, eff 8-22-00, EXPIRED: 8-22-08\n\nNew. #9375, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10025, eff 11-16-11, EXPIRED: 11-16-19\n\nNew. #13019, eff 4-7-20",
